## Precision of a rate from n cards (half-width of the 95% CP interval)
  n= 100: p=0.025: ±0.034, p=0.100: ±0.064, p=0.500: ±0.102
  n= 200: p=0.025: ±0.025, p=0.100: ±0.044, p=0.500: ±0.071
